{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_21","type":"agent_message","text":"Testing has already caught two control/integration problems: mouse coordinates needed conversion before reaching physics, and online player records needed mapping to seat IDs. Both are fixed. The AI Hub runtime checks passed, including four-player traffic and a dedicated host; I’m adding the required catalogue tags and checking the remaining gameplay and menu paths."}}
