{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_22","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '35,100p' hub/README.md; sed -n '1,180p' hub-integration-test.py\"","aggregated_output":"- **Parallel**: every player plays their own copy of the round, from the same\n  start. Each copy reports its score to the hub.\n- **Ghost**: as parallel, and each copy also shows the other players'\n  characters where they are, when they are in the same area of the game.\n  Those characters do not affect anything in the copy that shows them.\n- **Shared world**: all players play in one world. The host's copy runs that\n  world; the other copies send it what their own player does, and show the\n  world the host sends them.\n\nGames tagged with the older modes keep working: `race` is played as ghost,\n`co-op` and `versus` as shared world.\n\n---\n\n## A round\n\n1. The hub loads the game on every player's device, and the players get 10\n   to 30 seconds with the game's card, longer if one asks for more time: what\n   the game is, how to win, the controls. The card is the hub's, from the\n   game's tags, or the game's own (*The card*).\n2. The game connects and calls `ready()`.\n3. The round starts on the hub's clock, on every device at once.\n4. The game reports how it goes.\n5. The round ends when every player has a result, when the host of a shared\n   world finishes it, or when the hub calls time. The hub shows the results\n   over the game, then removes it.\n\n### Tags\n\nIn the game's `<head>`:\n\n```html\n<meta name=\"hub:session\" content=\"1\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-players\" content=\"MIN-MAX\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-mode\" content=\"MODE\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-goal\" content=\"GOAL\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-howto\" content=\"CONTROLS\">\n```\n\n- `hub:session-players`: the smallest and largest number of players the game\n  takes in a session. The hub deals the game only when the number of players\n  is in that range.\n- `hub:session-mode`: `parallel`, `ghost` or `shared-world`.\n- `hub:session-goal` and `hub:session-howto`: how to win and the game's\n  controls, shown on the hub's card.\n\nOptional:\n\n- `hub:session-minutes`: how many minutes a round of the game takes. The hub\n  shows it and uses it to decide when to call time.\n- `hub:webgpu` with `required`: the game cannot run without WebGPU. The hub\n  then deals it only when every player's browser has WebGPU.\n\n### The client\n\n[session.js](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/michaelcrosato/ai-hub/main/lib/hub/session.js)\nis pasted into the game unmodified, as the first script in `<head>`, right\nafter `<meta charset>`. In a session it:\n\n- seeds `Math.random`, in parallel and ghost, before any of the game's own\n  scripts run, so it gives the same numbers on every copy;\n- gives the game an empty `localStorage` and `sessionStorage` of its own, so\n  nothing stored on the device carries into the round, and nothing the round\n  stores reaches the device's own storage;\n- hands `requestFullscreen()` and `exitFullscreen()` to the hub, which takes\n  its whole page fullscreen; `document.fullscreenElement` and\n\"\"\"Run AI Hub's exact browser harness scenarios against the packaged Kapop HTML.\nPrint failures and a single count. Own server binds an OS-assigned loopback port.\n\"\"\"\nimport functools\nimport http.server\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport sys\nimport threading\nfrom urllib.parse import urlencode\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\n\nfolder=Path(__file__).resolve().parent\nslug=folder.name\nroot=folder.parent\nclass QuietHandler(http.server.SimpleHTTPRequestHandler):\n    def log_message(self,*args): pass\nserver=http.server.ThreadingHTTPServer(('127.0.0.1',0),functools.partial(QuietHandler,directory=str(root)))\nthreading.Thread(target=server.serve_forever,daemon=True).start()\nfailures=[]\ncount=0\nrecords=[]\nscenarios=[('standard-2',{'players':2}),('stress-4',{'players':4,'latency':150,'jitter':50,'loss':5}),('host-leave-4',{'players':4,'latency':150,'jitter':50,'loss':5,'scenario':'host-leave'}),('server-2',{'players':2,'scenario':'server'})]\ntry:\n    with sync_playwright() as p:\n        browser=p.chromium.launch(headless=True,args=['--no-sandbox','--enable-unsafe-webgpu','--enable-features=Vulkan','--use-webgpu-adapter=swiftshader'])\n        for name,settings in scenarios:\n            context=browser.new_context(viewport={'width':1600,'height':1000})\n            page=context.new_page()\n            params={'game':'../../'+slug+'.html','auto':1,**settings}\n            url=f'http://127.0.0.1:{server.server_port}/{slug}/hub/harness.html?'+urlencode(params)\n            try:\n                page.goto(url)\n                assert page.title()=='AI Hub Session Harness'\n                page.wait_for_function(\"document.body.dataset.complete==='true'\",timeout=180000)\n                report=page.evaluate('window.__hubCheck')\n                records.append({'name':name,'report':report})\n                for check in report.get('checks',[]):\n                    if check.get('pass'): count+=1\n                    else: failures.append(name+': '+check.get('name','check')+' '+str(check.get('detail','')))\n                if not report.get('pass') and not any(not c.get('pass') for c in report.get('checks',[])):\n                    failures.append(name+': harness did not pass')\n            except Exception as error:\n                failures.append(name+': '+str(error))\n                records.append({'name':name,'error':str(error),'log':page.locator('#log').text_content()})\n            context.close()\n        browser.close()\nexcept Exception as error:\n    failures.append(str(error))\nfinally:\n    server.shutdown()\n    server.server_close()\n(folder/'hub-test-results.json').write_text(json.dumps({'passed':count,'failures':failures,'scenarios':records},indent=2))\nfor failure in failures: print('FAIL AI Hub '+failure)\nprint(f'{count} AI Hub checks passed; {len(failures)} failed')\nsys.exit(1 if failures else 0)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_23","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\np='template.html';s=open(p).read().replace('<\"'!--HUB_SESSION-->'\"','''<\"'!--HUB_SESSION-->\n<meta name=\"hub:session\" content=\"1\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-players\" content=\"1-4\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-mode\" content=\"shared-world\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-goal\" content=\"Catch the rooftop crook’s bombs through five rounds. Share three buckets and survive together.\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-howto\" content=\"Move with left stick, D-pad, A/D, arrows, mouse or touch drag. Cross/A, Space, click or second touch splashes nearby bombs. Catches are automatic.\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-minutes\" content=\"3\">'\"''');open(p,'w').write(s)\np='main.js';s=open(p).read().replace('if(pressed(1)||pressed(9))back();','if(pressed(1)||(pressed(9)&&\"'!b[8]))back();'\"');open(p,'w').write(s)\nPY\nnode build.mjs\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_23","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\np='template.html';s=open(p).read().replace('<\"'!--HUB_SESSION-->'\"','''<\"'!--HUB_SESSION-->\n<meta name=\"hub:session\" content=\"1\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-players\" content=\"1-4\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-mode\" content=\"shared-world\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-goal\" content=\"Catch the rooftop crook’s bombs through five rounds. Share three buckets and survive together.\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-howto\" content=\"Move with left stick, D-pad, A/D, arrows, mouse or touch drag. Cross/A, Space, click or second touch splashes nearby bombs. Catches are automatic.\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-minutes\" content=\"3\">'\"''');open(p,'w').write(s)\np='main.js';s=open(p).read().replace('if(pressed(1)||pressed(9))back();','if(pressed(1)||(pressed(9)&&\"'!b[8]))back();'\"');open(p,'w').write(s)\nPY\nnode build.mjs\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_24","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\np='main.js';s=open(p).read().replace(\\\"net.finish(sim.phase==='victory',sim.score,sim.stats)\\\",\\\"net.finish(sim.phase==='victory',sim.score,sim.stats,sim.snapshot())\\\").replace(\\\"let s={...(remote||sim.snapshot())};s.phase\\\", \\\"let s={...(e?.state||remote||sim.snapshot())};s.phase\\\").replace(\\\"inputX=sim.players[Math.max(0,localIndex)]?.x||0;},onInput\\\", \\\"inputX=sim.players[Math.max(0,localIndex)]?.x||0;net.sendInput({x:inputX,pop:false});},onInput\\\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nPY\nnode build.mjs\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_24","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\np='main.js';s=open(p).read().replace(\\\"net.finish(sim.phase==='victory',sim.score,sim.stats)\\\",\\\"net.finish(sim.phase==='victory',sim.score,sim.stats,sim.snapshot())\\\").replace(\\\"let s={...(remote||sim.snapshot())};s.phase\\\", \\\"let s={...(e?.state||remote||sim.snapshot())};s.phase\\\").replace(\\\"inputX=sim.players[Math.max(0,localIndex)]?.x||0;},onInput\\\", \\\"inputX=sim.players[Math.max(0,localIndex)]?.x||0;net.sendInput({x:inputX,pop:false});},onInput\\\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nPY\nnode build.mjs\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_25","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > browser-test.py <<'EOF'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json,sys\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\nfolder=Path(__file__).resolve().parent\nurl=(folder.parent/(folder.name+'.html')).as_uri()\nchecks=0;failures=[];errors=[]\ndef check(value,name):\n global checks\n checks+=1\n if not value:failures.append(name)\ndef wait_check(page,expression,name):\n try:page.wait_for_function(expression,timeout=12000);check(True,name)\n except Exception:check(False,name)\ntry:\n with sync_playwright() as p:\n  browser=p.chromium.launch(headless=True,args=['--enable-unsafe-webgpu','--enable-features=Vulkan','--use-webgpu-adapter=swiftshader'])\n  page=browser.new_page(viewport={'width':1600,'height':900})\n  page.add_init_script(\\\"\\\"\\\"window.testPad=null;Object.defineProperty(navigator,'getGamepads',{value:()=>window.testPad?[window.testPad]:[]});window.setPad=(x=0,buttons=[])=>window.testPad={id:'Test standard pad',index:0,connected:true,mapping:'standard',axes:[x,0,0,0],buttons:Array.from({length:17},(_,i)=>({pressed:buttons.includes(i),value:buttons.includes(i)?1:0,touched:buttons.includes(i)}))};\\\"\\\"\\\")\n  page.on('pageerror',lambda e:errors.append(str(e)))\n  page.goto(url);page.wait_for_function('window.__kapop?.ready',timeout=90000)\n  page.evaluate('window.__kapop.freeze(true)')\n  check(page.evaluate('window.__kapop.screen')=='title','title ready without interaction')\n  check(page.evaluate('window.__kapop.audio.inspect().musicVolume')==.1,'music defaults to ten percent')\n  check(page.evaluate('window.__kapop.scene.inspect().backend')=='webgpu','real WebGPU initialized')\n  check(page.evaluate('window.__kapop.scene.inspect().animationClips')>=44,'native animation clips cover scene')\n  page.keyboard.press('ArrowDown');page.keyboard.press('Enter')\n  check(page.evaluate('window.__kapop.screen')=='together','keyboard menu focus and confirm')\n  page.keyboard.press('Escape');page.click('[data-action=how]')\n  check('Pink bombs' in page.locator('#panel').inner_text(),'instructions explain advanced mechanics')\n  page.keyboard.press('Escape');page.click('[data-action=solo]');page.evaluate('window.__kapop.freeze(false)')\n  page.mouse.move(250,650)\n  wait_check(page,'Number.isFinite(window.__kapop.sim.players[0].x)&&window.__kapop.sim.players[0].target < -3','mouse produces finite world position')\n  page.wait_for_timeout(200);old=page.evaluate('window.__kapop.sim.players[0].x')\n  page.keyboard.down('KeyD');page.wait_for_timeout(300);page.keyboard.up('KeyD')\n  check(page.evaluate('window.__kapop.sim.players[0].x')>old,'keyboard moves bucket right')\n  page.keyboard.press('Escape');t=page.evaluate('window.__kapop.sim.time');page.wait_for_timeout(250)\n  check(page.evaluate('window.__kapop.paused') and page.evaluate('window.__kapop.sim.time')==t,'pause freezes simulation')\n  page.click('[data-action=settings]');page.locator('#music').fill('.25');page.locator('#sfx').fill('.35')\n  check(page.evaluate('window.__kapop.audio.inspect().musicVolume')==.25,'settings apply music live')\n  page.click('[data-action=glyphs]');check(page.evaluate('window.__kapop.settings.glyphs')=='xbox','Xbox glyph setting')\n  page.click('[data-action=resetprefs]');check(page.evaluate('window.__kapop.settings.music')==.1,'reset settings defaults')\n  page.keyboard.press('Escape');page.click('[data-action=dev]');page.locator('#dev-fallSpeed').fill('1.5');page.locator('#dev-catchWidth').fill('1.5');page.click('[data-action=invincible]')\n  check(page.evaluate('window.__kapop.sim.settings.fallSpeed===1.5 && window.__kapop.sim.settings.invincible'),'dev controls change live gameplay')\n  page.click('[data-action=resetdev]');check(page.evaluate('window.__kapop.sim.settings.fallSpeed===1&&\"'!window.__kapop.sim.settings.invincible'\"'),'dev reset restores balance')\n  page.keyboard.press('Escape');page.keyboard.press('Escape');check(page.evaluate('window.__kapop.screen') is None,'resume returns to game')\n  page.evaluate('window.__kapop.title();window.setPad(0,[0])')\n  wait_check(page,'window.__kapop.screen===null&&\"'!window.__kapop.sim.attract'\"','standard gamepad confirms title')\n  page.evaluate('window.setPad(0,[])');page.wait_for_timeout(120);page.evaluate('window.setPad(1,[])')\n  wait_check(page,\\\"window.__kapop.device==='pad'&&window.__kapop.sim.players[0].target>0\\\",'standard gamepad stick moves bucket')\n  page.evaluate('window.setPad(0,[])');page.wait_for_timeout(100);page.evaluate('window.setPad(0,[9])')\n  wait_check(page,\\\"window.__kapop.screen==='pause'\\\",'standard gamepad Options pauses')\n  page.evaluate('window.setPad(0,[])');page.wait_for_timeout(100);page.evaluate('window.setPad(0,[8,9])');page.wait_for_timeout(200)\n  check(page.evaluate('window.__kapop.screen')=='pause','Create plus Options does not alter pause')\n  page.evaluate('window.testPad=null;window.__kapop.title();window.__kapop.forceIdle()')\n  wait_check(page,'window.__kapop.sim.attract===true','ten-second title inactivity launches attract')\n  page.keyboard.press('KeyX');check(page.evaluate('window.__kapop.screen')=='title' and not page.evaluate('window.__kapop.sim.attract'),'any input exits attract')\n  page.evaluate('window.__kapop.start(2)');page.wait_for_timeout(150)\n  check(page.evaluate('window.__kapop.scene.inspect().visiblePlayers')==2,'couch co-op shows two catchers')\n  page.evaluate('window.__kapop.freeze(true)');page.click('#pauseButton');page.click('[data-action=dev]');page.click('[data-action=autocatch]');page.keyboard.press('Escape');page.keyboard.press('Escape')\n  report=page.evaluate('''()=>{let a=window.__kapop,g=a.sim,old=g.onEvent;g.onEvent=()=>{};g.start();g.settings.autoCatch=true;for(let i=0;i<18000&&g.phase==='playing';i++){if(g.wave>1&&g.charge===1&&g.bombs.some(b=>b.y<4))g.pop();g.step();}g.onEvent=old;return{phase:g.phase,wave:g.wave,score:g.score,stats:g.stats,lives:g.lives};}''')\n  check(report['phase']=='victory' and report['wave']==5 and report['lives']>0,'packaged-game full scripted playthrough')\n  check(report['stats']['gold']>0 and report['stats']['split']>0 and report['stats']['pops']>0,'playthrough covers every bomb and splash mechanic')\n  audio=page.evaluate('window.__kapop.testAudio()');checks+=audio['checks'];failures.extend('audio: '+v for v in audio['failures'])\n  page.evaluate(\\\"window.__kapop.title();window.__kapop.action('about')\\\")\n  text=page.locator('#panel').inner_text();check(all(s in text for s in ['Source Information','Testing Feedback','Engine Feedback','Prompt Feedback','added on import']),'about includes source and all feedback')\n  check(not errors,'no desktop runtime errors: '+str(errors))\n  page.close()\n  context=browser.new_context(**p.devices['iPhone 13'])\n  mobile=context.new_page();mobile.on('pageerror',lambda e:errors.append(str(e)));mobile.goto(url);mobile.wait_for_function('window.__kapop?.ready',timeout=90000)\n  mobile.touchscreen.tap(100,470) if False else None\n  mobile.locator('[data-action=solo]').tap();mobile.wait_for_timeout(150)\n  box=mobile.viewport_size\n  mobile.dispatch_event('#world','pointerdown',{'pointerType':'touch','pointerId':22,'clientX':100,'clientY':500})\n  mobile.dispatch_event('#world','pointermove',{'pointerType':'touch','pointerId':22,'clientX':190,'clientY':500})\n  wait_check(mobile,\\\"window.__kapop.device==='touch'&&window.__kapop.sim.players[0].target>1\\\",'touch drag controls invisible movement zone')\n  check(mobile.evaluate('window.__kapop.scene.inspect().viewHalfWidth')>=8.3,'portrait camera contains full playable width')\n  check(mobile.locator('#pauseButton').is_visible(),'touch pause button visible')\n  mobile.locator('#pauseButton').tap();check(mobile.evaluate('window.__kapop.screen')=='pause','touch pause menu works')\n  check(not errors,'no mobile runtime errors: '+str(errors));context.close();browser.close()\nexcept Exception as e:failures.append('browser suite: '+str(e))\nfor f in failures:print('FAIL '+f)\nprint(f'{checks} browser checks; {len(failures)} failures')\n(folder/'browser-test-results.json').write_text(json.dumps({'checks':checks,'failures':failures,'errors':errors},indent=2))\nsys.exit(1 if failures else 0)\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
