rified·composition.\"\n    24    │ - ··],\n    25    │ - ··\"engineFeedback\":·[\n    26    │ - ····\"Three.js·native·animation·clips·and·node·materials·made·the·illustrated·stage·and·expressive·characters·straightforward.\",\n    27    │ - ····\"I·initially·passed·a·pointer-coordinate·object·as·a·number·and·assumed·bucket·sensors·would·be·harmless.·Integration·tests·corrected·the·input·contract;·repeated·physics·cleanup·exposed·a·sensor·failure,·so·catching·uses·a·swept·crossing·test·while·Rapier·drives·the·bombs.\",\n    28    │ - ····\"The·catching·rules,·pacing,·menu·focus,·procedural·sound·and·shared-world·multiplayer·state.\",\n    29    │ - ····\"Coordinating·WebGPU·material·compilation,·physics·stepping·and·responsive·framing·in·a·single-file·build.\",\n    30    │ - ····\"none\",\n    31    │ - ····\"A·simpler·built-in·workflow·for·toon·shading·with·WebGPU.\"\n    32    │ - ··],\n    33    │ - ··\"promptFeedback\":·[\n    34    │ - ····\"The·source,·controller-first·design·and·full·vertical-slice·requirement·gave·the·game·a·clear·identity.\",\n    35    │ - ····\"The·no-research·rule·and·required·linked·multiplayer·documentation·needed·an·interpretation:·the·linked·implementation·was·read·directly.\",\n    36    │ - ····\"Making·the·complete·arcade·loop,·four-seat·hub·support·and·standalone·online·play·fit·a·polished·single-file·game.\",\n    37    │ - ····\"Specify·whether·standalone·online·play·may·rely·on·a·public·signaling·service.\"\n    38    │ - ··],\n    39    │ - ··\"aiHub\":·{\n    40    │ - ····\"name\":·\"Kapop\",\n    41    │ - ····\"tagline\":·\"One·crook.·Three·buckets.·A·sky·full·of·trouble.\",\n    42    │ - ····\"description\":·\"An·ink-and-paper·rooftop·catching·caper·inspired·by·Kaboom!·Chase·the·bomber·through·five·escalating·rounds,·catch·golden·bombs·and·rescue·your·streak·with·a·charged·splash,·alone·or·with·your·bucket·brigade.\",\n    43    │ - ····\"type\":·\"Game\",\n    44    │ - ····\"genre\":·\"Action\",\n    45    │ - ····\"s